Subject: [PATCH] feat(sessions): reclaim a turn lease its own process orphaned

A turn releases its session lease in its own finally. When that write fails (state.db locked past the write patience), the row stays until its 300 s TTL runs out, and picks, resets and compress on the idle session are deferred or refused as busy meanwhile. sessions.reclaim_orphaned_turn_leases (false by default) treats a lease row that names this process, but no live turn of it, as stale like a dead process's row.
